Package: ProReT
Type: Package
Title: Program-Level Reversal of Transcriptomes for Drug Repurposing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Author", "Name", email = "author@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Implements signed program-template alignment for transcriptomic
    drug repurposing. Disease signatures estimated from GEO Series Matrix
    files and LINCS L1000 compound perturbations are projected through the
    same user-supplied gene-by-program basis. Correlation among non-orthogonal
    templates is handled by regularized Gram whitening, and compounds are
    ranked by cross-cell-line aggregation of inverse cosine alignment.
